{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    h, n = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n\n    sl = [0] * 51\n    sl[0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, 51):\n        sl[i] = sl[i - 1] + (1 << i)\n\n    target = n + sl[h - 1]\n\n    anc = [target]\n    while anc[-1] != 1:\n        anc.append(anc[-1] // 2)\n\n    def dfs(cur, go_left, depth):\n        temp = []\n        node = cur\n        for _ in range(depth):\n            temp.append(node)\n            if go_left:\n                node <<= 1\n            else:\n                node = (node << 1) | 1\n            go_left = not go_left\n\n        if node == target:\n            return depth\n\n        temp.append(node)\n        temp.reverse()\n\n        for i in range(1, depth + 1):\n            if anc[i] == temp[i]:\n                add = sl[i - 1] + depth - i + 1\n                new_depth = i - 1\n                cur = temp[i - 1]\n                if cur == (temp[i] << 1):\n                    cur = (temp[i] << 1) | 1\n                    go_left = True\n                else:\n                    cur = temp[i] << 1\n                    go_left = False\n                return add + dfs(cur, go_left, new_depth)\n\n    print(dfs(1, True, h))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        new Main().solve();\n    }\n\n    private long[] sl;\n    private long target;\n    private List<Long> anc;\n\n    public void solve() {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int h = sc.nextInt();\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n\n        sl = new long[51];\n        sl[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= 50; i++) {\n            sl[i] = sl[i - 1] + (1L << i);\n        }\n\n        target = n + sl[h - 1];\n\n        anc = new ArrayList<>();\n        anc.add(target);\n        while (anc.get(anc.size() - 1) != 1) {\n            anc.add(anc.get(anc.size() - 1) / 2);\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(dfs(1, true, h));\n    }\n\n    private long dfs(long cur, boolean goLeft, int depth) {\n        List<Long> temp = new ArrayList<>();\n        long node = cur;\n        for (int i = 0; i < depth; i++) {\n            temp.add(node);\n            if (goLeft) {\n                node <<= 1;\n            } else {\n                node = (node << 1) | 1;\n            }\n            goLeft = !goLeft;\n        }\n\n        if (node == target) {\n            return depth;\n        }\n\n        temp.add(node);\n        Collections.reverse(temp);\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= depth; i++) {\n            if (anc.get(i).equals(temp.get(i))) {\n                long add = sl[i - 1] + depth - i + 1;\n                int newDepth = i - 1;\n                long newCur = temp.get(i - 1);\n                if (newCur == (temp.get(i) << 1)) {\n                    newCur = (temp.get(i) << 1) | 1;\n                    goLeft = true;\n                } else {\n                    newCur = temp.get(i) << 1;\n                    goLeft = false;\n                }\n                return add + dfs(newCur, goLeft, newDepth);\n            }\n        }\n        // Should never reach here\n        return 0;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.98\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.004157709423452616, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.564294092939235e-05, -1.4305104514278355e-06, 0.0, -7.486063259420916e-05, -0.42060545086860657, -6.437280717364047e-06, 0.0, -0.005237666890025139, -0.0009124883217737079, -0.00020525732543319464, -0.5822130441665649, 0.0, -0.018154410645365715, -9.60780744208023e-05, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -2.264974000354414e-06, -4.172238186583854e-05, -2.861018856492592e-06, -0.492783784866333, -0.00038532938924618065, 0.0, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -8.940656698541716e-06, -0.0005532164941541851, -0.01815113238990307, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.3987119495868683, -0.06404760479927063, -0.00011062010162277147, -2.264974000354414e-06, -0.3227507472038269, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.2852475345134735, -0.001320562674663961, -0.0005173536483198404, -3.576278118089249e-07, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -0.3271336555480957, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -0.00016389934171456844, -0.0369749590754509, 0.0, -0.4748152494430542, -3.099436753473128e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -1.7046782886609435e-05, -0.018443400040268898, 0.0, 0.0, -9.536738616588991e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -9.536697689327411e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0001662831346038729, -5.960462772236497e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.6689160474925302e-05, 0.0, -0.06197232007980347, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0009114163694903255, 0.0, -0.6974648833274841, 0.0, -0.00862397626042366, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -7.629365427419543e-06, -4.5536911784438416e-05, 0.0